UNTESTED. Written by reading bonesdeploy v0.8.7 (91f32c4), never applied or run.

What it does to the router template:
  - proxy_http_version 1.1 plus Upgrade/Connection headers, so a WebSocket
    handshake survives the router layer.
  - client_max_body_size from a new variable, nginx_client_max_body_size,
    defaulting to nginx's own 1m so existing sites do not change.

Two things assumed and not checked:
  - that project_name is in the render context for this template (it is for
    the AppArmor profile; not confirmed here). It names the map variable per
    project, because two sites defining the same map variable in one http
    block will stop nginx from loading.
  - that nginx_client_max_body_size can be passed through from bones.toml.
    That plumbing is not part of this patch.

The per-site template (frameworks/*/templates/nginx/app-site-nginx.conf.j2,
line 35, `proxy_set_header Connection "";`) needs the same treatment for
WebSockets to work end to end.

--- a/crates/bonesinfra/python/src/bonesinfra/assets/nginx/router.conf.j2
+++ b/crates/bonesinfra/python/src/bonesinfra/assets/nginx/router.conf.j2
@@ -1,3 +1,12 @@
+# WebSocket upgrade. The variable is named per project because every site's
+# router file is included into the same http block, and nginx refuses a second
+# map that defines the same variable.
+{% set ws_connection = "bones_" ~ (project_name | replace("-", "_") | replace(".", "_")) ~ "_connection" %}
+map $http_upgrade ${{ ws_connection }} {
+    default upgrade;
+    ""      "";
+}
+
 {% if preview_domain and ssl_domain and preview_domain != ssl_domain %}
 # When a real domain is configured, preview_domain redirects to it.
 server {
@@ -22,6 +31,10 @@
         proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
         proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
         proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
+        proxy_http_version 1.1;
+        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
+        proxy_set_header Connection ${{ ws_connection }};
+        client_max_body_size {{ nginx_client_max_body_size | default("1m") }};
     }
 
     location ^~ /.well-known/acme-challenge/ {
@@ -48,6 +61,10 @@
         proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
         proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
         proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
+        proxy_http_version 1.1;
+        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
+        proxy_set_header Connection ${{ ws_connection }};
+        client_max_body_size {{ nginx_client_max_body_size | default("1m") }};
     }
 }
 {% endif %}
